<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Observation2:<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Some women’s casual blouses.</span></span></span>
