<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000096;">Recommend<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.10.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">List 1: blouses with attributes for casual gatherings.</span></span>
<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#960000;">Fail</span></span>
