<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Action3[Searcher]:<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.15.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Search for specific attributes of blouses for gathering with friends.</span></span></span>
<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.16" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Observation3:<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.16.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> More detailed attributes.</span></span></span>
