<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.18" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.18.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Action4[Item Retriever]:<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.18.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Retrieve blouses with detailed attributes for a casual gathering.</span></span></span>
<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.19" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Observation4:<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.19.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Some women’s niche blouses.</span></span></span>
<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.20" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Thought4:<span id="S6.F5.pic1.1.20.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> I have got enough information to make a recommendation.</span></span></span>
